{"id": "DfEKmmkSwnh", "title": "Video by artandartists_ai", "description": "Dwarka ke raja ban kar bhi… Krishna kabhi Vrindavan ko, kabhi Radha ko bhool nahi paaye 🦚\n\nSamundar ke kinare sone ki Dwarka, aur kamar mein ek bansuri jo phir kabhi nahi baji.\nUski saans ek sunehra dhaaga ban kar Yamuna tak gayi… aur Radha ki naraazgi pe toot gayi.\nBaawan diye, baawan tarah se manaaya… samundar ki lehron mein bhi wahi dikhi.\nAakhir mein bas chaand reh gaya… aur akeli padi bansuri.\n\n“Udho, mohe Braj bisrat naahin” 🙏\n\n🎵 Bhare Naina · Ra.One · Nandini Srikar · Vishal-Shekhar · lyrics Panchhi Jalonvi · T-Series\n\nPrem mein bhagwan ki aankhein bhi bhar aayi thi… usko bhejo jiske bina sab adhoora lagta hai 🤍\n\nBhare Naina | Radha Krishna | Krishna missing Radha | Radha Krishna love story | Dwarka | Vrindavan | Krishna bansuri | T-Series | painted animation | lyrics reel\n\n#RadhaKrishna #BhareNaina #Krishna #TSeries #RadheRadhe", "channel": "artandartists_ai", "uploader_id": "17104311819", "uploader": "Art & Artists - AI", "timestamp": 1793248774, "like_count": 6029, "comment_count": 10, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1945493326893572a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 62.402, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMGT9LKgdc0CLXpQHowFSuelEs9178B_oOYqb5K3s-BOusU-QdfVm1lWg1hqf5HYO8qy8JvppjFffBucGYXk5USJ1WTadSfZMNyU6A.mp4?_nc_cat=100&_nc_oc=AdqD2arQhfMtoKatQcWghbgBhtLVoue1PNftqHEGhsAc0jUHIZuLcOEc1XOUGgeajWoVZULiQEBy0c23jcKzcFJg&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=iijqS1T6GOcQ7kNvwED8sT4&%3D%3D&ccb=